  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FA-Youth Focused Development, Swaziland</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will seek to improve livelihoods by providing young people with knowledge of the VSLA approach, training in entrepreneurship and the skills for enterprise start-up, to spur them to explore their creative and entrepreneurial ideas.  Training will equip youths to manage Income Generation Activities (IGAs) efficiently and profitably. Activities include conceptual and skill-building workshops, guest lectures by entrepreneurs, field visits and business simulations.</narrative>
  </description>
